## ⚙️ Tools of the Trade

- **Source**: ServiceNow Knowledge Management + Attachment APIs  
- **Ingestion/Orchestration**: Python, LangChain / LlamaIndex / Haystack  
- **Vector DB / Index**:  
  - Managed → Azure AI Search (BM25 + HNSW + RRF)  
  - OSS → Qdrant / Weaviate / OpenSearch (BM25 + k-NN)  
- **Embeddings**: OpenAI / HuggingFace models (e.g., `text-embedding-3-large`, `bge-large`)  
- **Reranker**: Cohere Rerank API or open-source BGE cross-encoder  
- **LLM**: Azure OpenAI, Anthropic, or local model  
- **OCR (if needed)**: Azure Document Intelligence, AWS Textract, Google Document AI  
- **Evaluation**: Ragas, DeepEval  

