## 📊 Cost & Scaling Notes
- **Traditional Search**: cheapest, ms latency, keyword only.  
- **RAG (Hybrid)**: upfront embedding cost (~$26K for 1 TB of text), higher infra, but best semantic accuracy.  
- **LLM-only Search**: impractical for >GB data.  

---

## ✅ Takeaways
- Use **Hybrid Retrieval (BM25 + HNSW + RRF + Reranker)** → current industry standard.  
- Preserve **ServiceNow ACLs** by syncing User Criteria into metadata.  
- Evaluate with **Ragas/DeepEval** before rollout.  
- Start simple (Azure AI Search or Qdrant) → scale up later.  

